# .forceignore excludes files from deploy and retrieve operations.
# Source: https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.sfdx_dev.meta/sfdx_dev/sfdx_dev_exclude_source.htm

# Tooling and runner artefacts
**/node_modules
**/.sfdx
**/.sf
**/.vibeforce
**/.localdevserver
**/coverage
**/jest.config.js
**/jest.config.mjs
**/eslint.config.mjs
**/eslint.config.js
**/.eslintrc*
**/.prettierrc*
**/.prettierignore
**/package.json
**/package-lock.json
**/README.md
**/*.test.js
**/__tests__/**
**/jest-mocks/**

# LWC editor scaffolding that must never be deployed
**/lwc/jsconfig.json
**/lwc/.eslintrc.json
**/aura/.eslintrc.json

# Metadata that is environment specific or managed outside source control.
# Uncomment the entries your org actually needs.
# **/profiles/**
# **/settings/**
# **/connectedApps/**
# **/namedCredentials/**
# **/certs/**
# **/siteDotComSites/**
# **/networks/**
# **/sharingRules/**
# **/duplicateRules/**

# Package directories in a multi-package project sometimes share a translation file; keep the
# generated ones out of source tracking.
**/*.translation-meta.xml
